  <Description>&lt;h1&gt;
      Incoming to Standard 121
    &lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;
      Overview:
    &lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      The Incoming to Standard 121 route accepts either an Acord 103 or Nailba 
      document and transforms it into a non-normalized Acord 121 document. The 
      Acord 121 document is then forwarded to the 121 Normalization route.
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;
      Source:
    &lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      The only source for this route is currently the Document Type Discovery 
      route.
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;
      Listener:
    &lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      There are two listners, one for each document type, which are both 
      Programmable Listeners that must be called from a previous route.
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;
      Source Transform:
    &lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      Depending on the listener called, the transformation performed will be 
      either Nailba to Acord 121 or Acord 103 to Acord 121. In the case of the 
      Nailba transformation, the Nailba format is converted to intermediary 
      XML via the file specificaiton &amp;quot;NAILBADefinition.xml&amp;quot; then transformed 
      to a non-normalized Acord 121 document via the &amp;quot;NAILBAToAcord.xslt&amp;quot; 
      style sheet. In the case of Acord 103, the &amp;quot;103-2-121.xslt&amp;quot; style sheet 
      is applied to output a non-normalized Acord 121 document.
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;
      Route:
    &lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      No routing rules are applied. Any transaction, at this point, is 
      forwarded to the 121 Normalization target.
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;
      Target Transform:
    &lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      Relay to 121 Normalization transport.
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;
      Transport:
    &lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      The now, non-normalized Acord 121 containing transaction is forwarded to 
      the 121 Normalization route.
    &lt;/p&gt;</Description>
</Route>

